      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">AlmaLinux vs Rocky Linux vs Ubuntu VPS 2026: Which OS Should You Choose?</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-6">CentOS is gone. The "which Linux for my VPS" question in 2026 is no longer CentOS vs Ubuntu — it's three actively maintained, RHEL-derived and Debian-derived options, all excellent on a $2-5/mo KVM VPS. We tested them head-to-head on package availability, panel support, AI inference, and migration paths from CentOS 7/8 so you can pick the right one in five minutes.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">AlmaLinux</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">Rocky Linux</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border-white/10">Ubuntu LTS</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">CentOS Replacement</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10">VPS OS</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

